# The wizard writes the configuration: theme, icons, the status bar, colors.
title lmux setup
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
chapter The wizard
caption lmux setup | the look, the layout, the sandbox, in five steps
type lmux setup
enter
wait 2.5
frame 3.5
caption enter | the theme a workspace opens with is monokai
keys Enter
wait 1.2
frame 2.5
keys Enter
wait 1.2
frame 2.5
keys C-c
wait 0.8
frame 1.5
